# vectorcraft 0.18.0: target_arch = "wasm32" means the browser build
# (apps/vectorcraft-web) here; Kandelo takes the native paths (files
# opened by path, rayon threads, rfd, arboard, webbrowser). Every such cfg
# reads all(target_arch = "wasm32", not(target_os = "kandelo")). Kandelo
# has no X server, so the app asks eframe for Wayland only there.
# The workspace [patch] also names three egui crates Cargo.lock does not
# use; vendoring skips them and an offline build stops on them.
diff -ruN a/Cargo.toml b/Cargo.toml
--- a/Cargo.toml	2026-10-29 21:03:56
+++ b/Cargo.toml	2026-10-30 13:25:18
@@ -160,8 +160,5 @@
